meta {
  name: Follows - Post - Follow
  type: http
  seq: 166
}

put {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of a discussion space>/posts/<post cuid>/follow
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Follow a post thread (#1475): the member is told about its new comments (level 2, Following). A member who writes a post or a comment follows its thread by themselves, a mention does not make them follow. A thread that the member follows already keeps its reason. Needs notifications:write.
}
